[h1]Suggestions[/h1]
Ideas for new sort or filter categories, changes to existing ones, and translation corrections go here. One suggestion per reply so each can be discussed and tracked on its own. Bugs go in the Bug Reports thread, questions in the Questions thread.

[h2]What helps[/h2]
[list]
    [*]The problem you are trying to solve, not only the feature you have in mind. An existing category or modifier sometimes already covers it.
    [*]Whether it is a Sort category, a Filter category, or a Search change.
    [*]For translation fixes: the game language, the exact current text, and the text you propose.
[/list]

[h2]Ground rules[/h2]
[list]
    [*]Filters and sorts work against the game's own item data (tier, damage, weight, culture, and so on). A suggestion that needs data the game does not track is out of scope.
    [*]This mod targets Bannerlord v1.4.0 through v1.4.8.
[/list]

[h2]What happens next[/h2]
Accepted suggestions ship in a MINOR or PATCH update and are listed in the Change Notes tab. A reply in this thread will say which version carries it. Declined ones get a reply with the reason.
